Source common.tape
Output compact_tree.mp4
Env SCENE_FILE "prime/Prime.lean:8"
Source open.tape

Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type "[" Sleep 2s
Ctrl+B Left Sleep 500ms
Type "10gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Type "15gg" Type "gs" Sleep 300ms Type " h" Sleep 2500ms Type ",;"
Ctrl+B Right Sleep 500ms
Type@400ms "jjk"
Sleep 3s
